OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed after car collides with
OL,4,Athree cyclists in Port Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cyclist has died in a crash on a busy
OL,7,Froad in Inverclyde.
OL,9,FThe 46-year-old man was one of three
OL,10,Fcyclists in a collision with a blue
OL,11,FFord C-Max Zetec on the A8 in Port
OL,12,FGlasgow shortly after 19:00 on Tuesday.
OL,13,FHe died at the scene.
OL,15,FTwo other male cyclists, aged 37 and
OL,16,F27, were taken to hospital following
OL,17,Fthe crash on the road's westbound
OL,18,Fcarriageway between the Langbank and
OL,19,FWoodhead roundabouts.
OL,21,FThe road was temporarily closed but has
OL,22,Fsince reopened.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
